WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.392 --> 00:00:20.789
The soldiers brought Cao Cao to the local magistrate, Chen Gong.

2
00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:26.997
Chen Gong glared at Cao Cao. "You planned to assassinate Dong Zhuo.

3
00:00:26.998 --> 00:00:34.050
You're a traitor to the Han Dynasty."

4
00:00:34.051 --> 00:00:44.512
He had Cao Cao thrown into a jail cell.

5
00:00:44.513 --> 00:00:53.553
But late that night, Chen Gong secretly visited Cao Cao.

6
00:00:53.554 --> 00:00:57.762
"Where were you going?" the magistrate asked.

7
00:00:57.763 --> 00:01:02.013
"I was riding to my family home in Qiao," Cao Cao said.

8
00:01:02.014 --> 00:01:06.678
"I plan to raise an army and overthrow Dong Zhuo."

9
00:01:06.679 --> 00:01:08.929
Chen Gong bit his lip.

10
00:01:08.930 --> 00:01:16.641
"I'm supposed to send you back to Luoyang, but Dong Zhuo must be stopped."

11
00:01:16.642 --> 00:01:24.220
"Join me," Cao Cao urged. "Help me wipe out Dong Zhuo and restore peace to China."

12
00:01:24.221 --> 00:01:32.137
Chen Gong quit his job in Zhongmu County.

13
00:01:32.138 --> 00:01:35.883
As he headed off with Cao Cao, he bowed his head.

14
00:01:35.884 --> 00:01:40.387
"I'm no longer a magistrate upholding the law," he thought.

15
00:01:40.388 --> 00:01:46.803
"I'm now a criminal on the run."

16
00:01:46.804 --> 00:01:50.928
A few days later, they arrived at a small farm.

17
00:01:50.929 --> 00:01:53.558
"We'll be safe here," Cao Cao said.

18
00:01:53.559 --> 00:01:58.887
"The farmer is named Lu Boshe. He's friends with my father."

19
00:01:58.888 --> 00:02:02.782
The old farmer greeted Cao Cao and Chen Gong warmly.

20
00:02:02.783 --> 00:02:09.912
"It's wonderful to see you, Cao Cao. Please come in."

21
00:02:09.913 --> 00:02:19.383
The three men went inside.

22
00:02:19.384 --> 00:02:24.950
"My workers will prepare a nice meal for us," Lu Boshe said.

23
00:02:24.951 --> 00:02:31.345
"But I don't have anything to drink. I'll go to the market."

24
00:02:31.346 --> 00:02:37.264
After the old man left, Cao Cao and Chen Gong lay down to rest.

25
00:02:37.265 --> 00:02:43.470
Outside, the wind rustled leaves. Birds chirped.

26
00:02:43.471 --> 00:02:51.549
A pig snorted. Cao Cao was nearly asleep when he heard two men murmuring.

27
00:02:51.550 --> 00:02:54.878
"Lu Boshe told us to catch this one."

28
00:02:54.879 --> 00:02:58.678
"He's in there. Don't let him get away."

29
00:02:58.679 --> 00:03:06.178
Cao Cao's blood ran cold. "Chen Gong," he whispered. "Wake up."

30
00:03:06.179 --> 00:03:10.637
Chen Gong rubbed his eyes. "What's wrong?"

31
00:03:10.638 --> 00:03:14.222
"Lu Boshe betrayed us!" Cao Cao said.

32
00:03:14.223 --> 00:03:19.595
"His men are planning to trap us here while he finds officials to arrest us."

33
00:03:19.596 --> 00:03:27.470
Silently they slipped outside and went around to the side of the house.

34
00:03:27.471 --> 00:03:33.387
Two men stood outside a pigpen. They both held knives.

35
00:03:33.388 --> 00:03:36.482
Cao Cao hurried toward them.

36
00:03:36.483 --> 00:03:40.907
"Oh, hello!" one said. "We're planning to—"

37
00:03:40.908 --> 00:03:48.083
Cao Cao drew his sword and attacked. The man fell at once.

38
00:03:48.084 --> 00:03:52.120
The other man gasped. "Why did you—?"

39
00:03:52.121 --> 00:03:56.012
Slash! Cao Cao struck again.

40
00:03:56.013 --> 00:04:00.697
Everything was quiet. Then they heard a pig snort.

41
00:04:00.698 --> 00:04:06.149
Cao Cao looked over and noticed a large pig inside the pen.

42
00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:13.095
He looked down at the two dead men. Their knives lay near them.

43
00:04:13.096 --> 00:04:18.628
Chen Gong gulped. "Those knives were for butchering!

44
00:04:18.629 --> 00:04:21.803
And they were talking about the pig, not us.

45
00:04:21.804 --> 00:04:24.589
You just killed two innocent men!"

46
00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:29.156
Cao Cao shrugged. "They're just poor workers.

47
00:04:29.157 --> 00:04:31.991
Besides, it's better to be safe.

48
00:04:31.992 --> 00:04:42.769
I'd rather destroy the world than let the world destroy me."

49
00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:49.417
That night, as Cao Cao slept, Chen Gong tossed and turned.

50
00:04:49.418 --> 00:04:56.220
He couldn't believe that Cao Cao had even killed Lu Boshe, who was returning from the market.

51
00:04:56.221 --> 00:04:59.846
"I thought Cao Cao was honorable," he thought.

52
00:04:59.847 --> 00:05:03.928
"But instead he's cruel and heartless."

53
00:05:03.929 --> 00:05:09.961
He pulled out his sword and thought about ending Cao Cao's life.

54
00:05:09.962 --> 00:05:17.512
Then he sighed. "There's already enough bloodshed in this world."

55
00:05:17.513 --> 00:05:24.053
Chen Gong packed his things and left.

56
00:05:24.054 --> 00:05:28.912
Cao Cao woke up the next morning and saw that Chen Gong was gone.

57
00:05:28.913 --> 00:05:32.470
He thought about what had happened the day before.

58
00:05:32.471 --> 00:05:38.096
"Chen Gong left because he thought I was evil." Cao Cao tapped his chin.

59
00:05:38.097 --> 00:05:42.942
"If I want to gather an army, I must be careful about what I say.

60
00:05:42.943 --> 00:05:46.887
I can't let people think I'm a simple thug."

61
00:05:46.888 --> 00:05:57.323
He packed his things, jumped onto his horse, and rode home.
